OL,3,GNEWSASoldiers undergo gruelling Gurkha
OL,4,Arace
OL,5,
OL,6,FSoldiers from the British Army have
OL,7,Ftaken part in a punishing Gurkha race
OL,8,Fin Surrey.
OL,10,FParticipants carried a traditional
OL,11,FNepalese Doko basket weighing 15kg more
OL,12,Fthan 5km at the Army Training Centre in
OL,13,FPirbright.
OL,15,FCorporal Nisaan Gurung said it was a
OL,16,F"big event" on the calendar, especially
OL,17,Ffor the Nepalese community.
OL,19,F"We were all looking forward to it," he
OL,20,Ftold BBC Radio Surrey.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
